Package: portable
Title: A PDF Graphics Device with Embedded Fonts
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Thomas Lin", "Pedersen", , "thomasp85@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5147-4711"))
Description: A PDF graphics device that uses systemfonts and textshaping for
    font lookup and text layout (the same font stack as the ragg devices) and
    embeds all used fonts so documents render identically everywhere.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Imports:
    grDevices,
    systemfonts (>= 1.1.0),
    textshaping (>= 0.4.0)
Suggests:
    grid,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
LinkingTo:
    systemfonts,
    textshaping
SystemRequirements: zlib
URL: https://github.com/r-lib/portable
BugReports: https://github.com/r-lib/portable/issues
